Additional notice:
- The gameplay mechanics of this project are a study recreation inspired by
  Plants vs. Zombies (PopCap/EA). "Plants vs. Zombies" is a trademark of
  PopCap/EA; this open-source project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
  them.
- All graphics in this project are original procedurally-generated vector
  drawings, and all music/SFX are original synthesized compositions created
  at runtime. No original game assets are included.
- Gameplay constants were referenced from the open-source recreations
  PvZ-Portable (wszqkzqk) and PVZ-Godot-Dream (hsk-dream), both of their
  respective licenses apply to their code (this project does not copy their
  code).
